  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b6ece7837f0e6c14ebcad7cfc05bc72e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dominion 2v2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: 3
  displayName: Dominion 2v2
  family: 1
  familyName: Dominion
  sizeName: 2v2
  teams: 0000000001000000
  seatsPerTeam: 2
  spectatorSeats: 3
  sceneName: Dominion 2v2
  available: 1
  lobbyModeValue: 2
  infoCards:
  - title: Rounds
    text: "Three rounds against the clock. The team with the most points when time runs out wins the round. If the top teams finish close, they play a short overtime: the first to pull well ahead wins the round, and if nobody does, each of them gets it. Win two rounds, or lead on round wins after the third, to win the match."
    accent: {r: 0.41960785, g: 0.24705882, b: 0.7490196, a: 1}
  - title: Zones and points
    text: "Every zone your team holds earns points every second. Your spawn heals you, but it can't be captured and earns nothing."
    accent: {r: 0.41960785, g: 0.24705882, b: 0.7490196, a: 1}
  - title: Bounties
    text: "Hold a zone long enough and it builds a bounty; whoever takes it from you collects the points."
    accent: {r: 0.41960785, g: 0.24705882, b: 0.7490196, a: 1}
  - title: Your build each round
    text: "Every round starts from scratch. In the break before it you pick your gear for free. Round one is the pistol only, round two opens the weapon families and an armor upgrade, and round three opens the weapon upgrades and a second armor upgrade."
    accent: {r: 0.9098039, g: 0.7254902, b: 0.19215687, a: 1}
  - title: Respawns
    text: "You always come back after the same short wait, inside a shield that blocks all damage, stuns and pushes. It breaks when its time runs out, when you hit an enemy or when you leave your spawn, and you can't capture while it's up."
    accent: {r: 0.41960785, g: 0.24705882, b: 0.7490196, a: 1}
  - title: Sudden death
    text: "If a shared round would win a team the match, the teams that shared it play sudden death for that round instead. After the third round, teams level on round wins play it for the match. No respawns, and a shrinking circle hurts anyone outside it. The last team standing wins."
    accent: {r: 0.41960785, g: 0.24705882, b: 0.7490196, a: 1}
